    "consumed": "Smash Primary",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Primary Effect</strong></p>\n<p>Dose lasts 4 hours.</p>\n<p>\n  The user feels happy and satisfied, receiving a temporary modifier of +2 to\n  the following skills\n</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Dance</li>\n  <li>Contortionist</li>\n  <li>Conversation</li>\n  <li>Human Perception</li>\n  <li>Persuasion</li>\n  <li>Acting</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Secondary Effect (DV15)</strong></p>\n<p>User is addicted to Smash.</p>\n<p>While addicted, user suffers a -2 modifier to the following skills</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Dance</li>\n  <li>Contortionist</li>\n  <li>Conversation</li>\n  <li>Human Perception</li>\n  <li>Persuasion</li>\n  <li>Acting</li>\n</ul>\n<p>GM will tell your when you crave more Smash. Roleplay accordingly.</p>\n"
    },
